    "helper.installView.step.uninstallOldDaemon" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ونظرا للانتقال من SMJOBBless إلى SMAPPService، يلزم الإزالة اليدوية لتراث ديميون.\nالرجاء تنفيذ الأوامر الطرفية التالية:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper. القائمة\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nبعد تشغيل هذه الأوامر، أعد تشغيل Mac."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Due to migration from SMJOBBless to SMAPPservice, manual removal of the legacy daemon is required.\nPlease execute the following Terminal commands:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nAfter running these commands, restart your Mac."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Due to migration from SMJOBBless to SMAPPservice, manual removal of the legacy daemon is required.\nPlease execute the following Terminal commands:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nAfter running these commands, restart your Mac."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Debido a la migración de SMJOBBless a SMAPPservice, se requiere la eliminación manual del daemon heredado.\nPor favor, ejecuta los siguientes comandos en Terminal:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nDespués de ejecutar estos comandos, reinicia tu Mac."
          }
        },
        "fa" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "به دلیل جابه‌جایی از SMJOBBless به SMAPPservice، حذف دستی دیمون قدیمی ضروری است.\nلطفاً دستورات زیر را در ترمینال اجرا کنید:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nپس از اجرای این دستورات، مک خود را دوباره راه‌اندازی کنید."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En raison de la migration de SMJOBBless vers SMAPPservice, il est nécessaire de supprimer l'ancien daemon. Merci de copier et d'exécuter les commandes suivantes dans le Terminal :\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nAprès avoir exécuté ces commandes, merci de redémarrer votre Mac."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SMJOBBless से SMAPPservice में माइग्रेशन के कारण, पुराने डेमन को मैनुअल रूप से हटाना आवश्यक है।\nकृपया निम्नलिखित टर्मिनल कमांड्स चलाएँ:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nइन कमांड्स को चलाने के बाद, अपने मैक को पुनरारंभ करें।"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A causa della migrazione da SMJOBBless a SMAPPservice, è necessaria la rimozione manuale del demone legacy.\nSi prega di eseguire i seguenti comandi terminali:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper. list\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nDopo aver eseguito questi comandi, riavvia il tuo Mac."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SMJOBBlessからSMAPPserviceへの移行のため、レガシーデーモンを手動で除去する必要があります。 以下のターミナルコマンドを実行してください。\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper list \n\n sudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nこれらのコマンドを実行した後、Macを再起動してください。"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Due to migration from SMJOBBless to SMAPPservice, manual removal of the legacy daemon is required.\nPlease execute the following Terminal commands:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nAfter running these commands, restart your Mac."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Devido à migração do SMJOBBless para o SMAPPservice, a remoção manual do daemon herdado é necessária. Por favor execute os seguintes comandos do Terminal:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nDepois de executar estes comandos, reinicie seu Mac."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Из-за миграции с SMJOBBless на SMAPPservice требуется вручную удалить устаревший демон. Пожалуйста, выполните следующие команды в Терминале:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nПосле выполнения этих команд перезагрузите ваш Mac."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Legacy daemon'ı manuel olarak kaldırmak için aşağıdaki Terminal komutlarını çalıştırın:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nBu komutları çalıştırdıktan sonra, Mac'inizi yeniden başlatın."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "У зв'язку з міграцією від SMJOBBless до SMAPPservice, необхідно вручну видалити застарілий демон. Будь ласка, виконайте наступні команди терміналу:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nПісля виконання цих команд перезавантажте ваш Mac."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Do quá trình chuyển đổi từ SMJOBBless sang SMAPPService, bạn cần gỡ thủ công daemon cũ. Vui lòng thực hiện các lệnh sau trong Terminal:\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\nSau khi chạy các lệnh này, hãy khởi động lại máy Mac của bạn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由于我们已从 SMJOBBless 迁移到 SMAPPservice，您需要手动删除旧守护程序。请执行以下终端指令：\n\nsudo launchctl unload /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/LaunchDaemons/net.nymtech.vpn.helper.plist\nsudo rm /Library/PrivilegedHelperTools/net.nymtech.vpn.helper\nsfltool resetbtm\n\n执行这些指令后，重新启动 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
